 465, "The FreeDOS Command Shell developed by many developers, please refer\r\n";
 466, "to the enclose HISTORY.TXT file.\r\n";
 467, "\r\n";
 468, "Currently maintained by Steffen Kaiser mailto:freecomfreedos.org\r\n";
